--- !u!114 &1078773985
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1078773982}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7d20f73aabcb4cfbaac49363662be3e1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  currentDialogueIndex: 0
  textStartOffset: 0
  dialogues:
  - texts:
    - Oh... light above... what am I to do?
    - I was on a scouting mission with some other frogs from my village, but we got
      separated!
    - I would go on ahead, but this yucky sludge icks up my whole deal... croak!
    - I'll just wait here until someone rescues me...
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
  - texts:
    - Say... did you come from over the bridge?
    - I've never seen anyone come up from the base. You must be the first in an age!
    - My village elders tell stories of people like you. They'd surely like to meet
      you!
    - That is, if I ever see my village again...
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
  - texts:
    - Hopefully my village will send someone for me soon.
    - This sludge means I'm not going anywhere!
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
  DialogueName: Ronolda
  LookAtOverride: {fileID: 0}
  CameraY: 0.7
